    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst tugisüsteem \u003e Riistvara",
    "content": "Kuidas kasutada NVIDIA GPU kodeerijat Swing Catalystis See tugiartikkel käsitleb NVIDIA GPU kodeerija vigade parandamist.\nMÄRKUS: Mitte kõik NVIDIA GPU’d ei ole toetatud.\nMÄRKUS: AMD ATI GPU’d ei ole üldse toetatud.\nEsmalt veenduge, et Swing Catalysti Video \u0026 Capture seadistustes on valitud GPU NVIDIA. Kui teil on rohkem kui 2 kaamerat, veenduge, et lubaksite paik jaotises “Täpsemad seadistused” jaotises Video Encoding.\nGo into capture mode and record a swing, if the swing triggers but does not complete see instructions below. Step 1: Click your start button and search Windows for “Graphics setting”\nStep 2: Turn on “Reduce latency and improve performance”\nStep 3: Under the Choose an app to set preference section make sure it’s set to desktop app and click browse.\nStep 4: Navigate to C:\\Program Files\\Initial Force\\Swing Catalyst\\bin and highlight the MotionCatalyst.exe then click add.\nStep 5: Highlight the newly added Motion Catalyst and click “options” then select “High performance GPU: NVIDIA XXXX”\n**Possible backup solution for some laptops **\nStep 1: Right click on your desktop and go to “NVIDIA Control Panel”. If it’s not present then please download and install the most recent drivers and control panel here: https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/drivers/\nStep 2: In the control panel go to “Manage 3D settings” should be 2nd option from the top on the left hand side.\nStep 3: Click the “Preferred graphics processor” drop down and change it from “Integrated graphics” to “High-performance NVIDIA processor”\nStep 4: Click apply and close the control panel, open Swing Catalyst and capture another recording to see if its fixed. If not please email support@swingcatalyst.com\n*click to enlarge\nLast updated: 2023-12-15 | View on official support site",
    "description": "See tugiartikel käsitleb NVIDIA GPU kodeerija vigade parandamist.",
    "tags": [
      "Troubleshooting",
      "Force-Data",
      "Backup"
    ],
    "title": "NVIDIA GPU kodeerija seadistamine",
    "uri": "/sc-support/et/hardware/nvidia-gpu-encoder/index.html"
